BaseStorageLib::calculateSlot
├── given valid inputs
│   ├── it should return deterministic slot
│   ├── it should match keccak256 computation
│   └── it should use STORAGE_POSITION constant
├── given different configId values
│   └── it should return different slots
├── given different account values
│   └── it should return different slots
├── given same configId and account
│   └── it should return same slot
└── given storage isolation matrix
    └── it should return unique slots for all combinations